BEGIN_SOUND_ATTACHMENT
EVENT_NAME event:/A380X/Airframe/Wind
VEH_PART cockpit 0
EVENT_START_COND sim/flightmodel/position/indicated_airspeed > 20
EVENT_END_COND sim/flightmodel/position/indicated_airspeed <= 18
END_SOUND_ATTACHMENT

BEGIN_SOUND_ATTACHMENT
EVENT_NAME event:/A380X/HighLift/Flaps
